# DEVELOPMENT WORKFLOW

## Document Priority System
- PRIMARY: stories.md - Main task tracking, update in REAL-TIME
- TECHNICAL: instructions.md - Implementation details, update on decisions
- LOGS: logs.md - Event logging, update on milestones

## Status Marking
- Complete: [x]
- In Progress: [-]
- Pending: [ ]

## Required Implementation Process
1. ANALYSIS PHASE
   - Use Sequential Thinking tool for breakdown
   - Check stories.md for context
   - Identify current story and sub-tasks
   - Update stories.md in real-time

2. IMPLEMENTATION GUIDELINES
   - Create minimal, focused files (max 200 lines)
   - Add error handling for ALL external calls
   - Include proper type definitions
   - Add JSDoc comments for ALL public functions
   - Update stories.md after each component completion

3. TESTING REQUIREMENTS
   - Write unit tests FIRST
   - Test ALL error handling paths
   - Verify performance meets requirements
   - Achieve minimum 80% branch coverage